    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h1>Remastered Edition</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Monster Girl and the Mysterious Adventure Remastered Edition&quot;</strong> is a refined remaster of the game originally released in March 2020, featuring enhanced graphics and improved systems. All graphics, including characters, dungeons, items, and UI, have been completely revamped.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While there are minimal changes to the characters, items, and dungeons available, if you are playing <strong>&quot;Monster Girl and the Mysterious Adventure&quot;</strong> for the first time, we highly recommend starting with this <strong>Remastered Edition</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Please note that save data from the original &quot;Monster Girl and the Mysterious Adventure&quot; cannot be transferred.</i></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a Mystery Dungeon-style roguelike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whenever the player takes an action, other monsters act as well\u2026 Progress through the dungeon using a turn-based system!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During your adventure, you\u2019ll encounter monster girls. Give them drinks, befriend them, or challenge them to a test of strength\u2014if they acknowledge you, they\u2019ll become your trusted <strong>Friends</strong>!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an adventurer, you suddenly find yourself trapped within a mysterious barrier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >According to <strong>Tarte</strong>, a monster you meet in the <strong>Starting Village</strong>, the only way to escape is to defeat the <strong>Tower Mage</strong> who resides in the <strong>Tower of Return</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat the mage, break the barrier, and escape safely\u2026 Your mysterious adventure begins!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a Mystery Dungeon-style roguelike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whenever the player takes an action, other monsters act as well\u2026 Progress through the dungeon using a turn-based system!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During your adventure, you\u2019ll encounter monster girls. Give them drinks, befriend them, or challenge them to a test of strength\u2014if they acknowledge you, they\u2019ll become your trusted <strong>Friends</strong>!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an adventurer, you suddenly find yourself trapped within a mysterious barrier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >According to <strong>Tarte</strong>, a monster you meet in the <strong>Starting Village</strong>, the only way to escape is to defeat the <strong>Tower Mage</strong> who resides in the <strong>Tower of Return</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat the mage, break the barrier, and escape safely\u2026 Your mysterious adventure begins!</p>",
    "short_description": "Turn monster girls into your &quot;Friends&quot; and embark on an adventure together! This is a rogue-like game inspired by &quot;Mystery Dungeon,&quot; where the terrain changes every time you challenge it.",
